## Native demo (re-recorded from 16a6652)

$ Xvfb :99 -screen 0 1920x1080x24 -nolisten tcp
# exit 0 (display :99)

$ DISPLAY=:99 … dbus-run-session -- pnpm desktop:demo
# window: Scarlet 1440x900 at 240,90 on :99

# Drive: hover clock → G → type 0:05.600 → Enter → G → type 0:40 → Enter → Escape
# Native log (scarlet-desktop.log):
# key key=g
# key key=Enter in="Jump to a time"
# transport seek to=5.6 playing=false
# seeked … t=5.6 … paused=true
# key key=g
# key key=Enter in="Jump to a time"
# alert message="Enter a time between 0:00 and 0:16." in="Working edit"
# key key=Escape in="Jump to a time"

$ ffmpeg -i out-full.mp4 -vf "crop=1040:820:640:140" -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p -r 30 -t 24 out.mp4
# exit 0
# h264 yuv420p 1040x820 30 fps 24.000s 720 frames 267K

$ ffmpeg -i out-full.mp4 -vf "crop=1040:820:640:140,fps=12,scale=960:758:flags=lanczos,palettegen=max_colors=64:stats_mode=diff" palette.png
$ ffmpeg -i out-full.mp4 -i palette.png -lavfi "crop=1040:820:640:140,fps=12,scale=960:758:flags=lanczos[x];[x][1:v]paletteuse=dither=bayer:bayer_scale=5:diff_mode=rectangle" preview.gif
# exit 0
# gif 960x758 12 fps 24.000s 288 frames 607K

Times on screen:
- Before: clock 0:00 / 0:16, overlay 0:00:00.233, playhead at start
- Typed: 0:05.600
- After Enter: clock 0:05 / 0:16, overlay 0:00:05.600, playhead ~0:05, paused
- Typed past end: 0:40
- After Enter: field still open, error "Enter a time between 0:00 and 0:16.", overlay still 0:00:05.600, playhead unmoved
- After Escape: field closed, clock 0:05 / 0:16, playhead unmoved
